---
import SidebarLayout from '../layouts/SidebarLayout.astro';
---

<SidebarLayout>
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Top Telemetry Micro-Bar -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between py-space-xs mb-space-sm font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-primary">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-ping"></span>
        GEO-FEED SYNC: ONLINE
      </span>
<span class="text-outline-variant">/</span>
<span>RECON SAT: SENTINEL-2B OSINT</span>
<span class="text-outline-variant">/</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">GRID RES: 0.5M/PX</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md">
<span class="text-secondary font-mono">LAT 12.6534° N // LON 43.4182° E</span>
<span class="bg-surface-container px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-tertiary">DATUM WGS-84</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 1. ENCABEZADO DE SECCIÓN GEOESPACIAL -->
<section class="mb-space-lg">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-lg shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
<!-- Reticle Ambient Decoration -->
<div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-space-md relative z-10 mb-space-md">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-1 uppercase tracking-widest">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">satellite_alt</span>
<span>Módulo de Reconocimiento Estratégico Multiespectral</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg-mobile text-headline-lg-mobile md:font-headline-lg md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight uppercase">
            Centro Cartográfico de Teatros de Conflicto
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl mt-1">
            Explora interactivamente fronteras en disputa, rutas marítimas estratégicas (chokepoints), despliegue de activos militares de alta precisión y análisis geopolítico en tiempo real derivado de telemetría OSINT y satelital.
          </p>
</div>
<!-- DEFCON / Session Badge -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm bg-surface-container px-space-md py-2 rounded self-start lg:self-auto">
<div class="flex flex-col text-right">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">POSTURA OPERATIVA</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-tertiary font-bold">VIGILANCIA ELEVADA</span>
</div>
<div class="w-2 h-8 bg-tertiary rounded-full"></div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Filters & Control Strip -->
<div class="pt-space-md bg-surface-container/60 p-space-sm rounded flex flex-col xl:flex-row gap-space-md items-start xl:items-center justify-between">
<!-- Region Filter Pills -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mr-2 uppercase flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">public</span> Región:
          </span>
<button class="bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold uppercase transition hover:brightness-110">
            Todas
          </button>
<button class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase transition">
            Oriente Medio
          </button>
<button class="bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase transition ring-0 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span> Mar Rojo
          </button>
<button class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase transition">
            Taiwán
          </button>
<button class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase transition">
            Ártico
          </button>
<button class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase transition">
            Cuerno de África
          </button>
</div>
<!-- Threat & Display Modes -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md">
<!-- Threat Mode Select -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">shield_with_heart</span> Amenaza:
            </span>
<div class="flex bg-surface-container-highest rounded p-0.5">
<button class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold uppercase">Naval</button>
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Terrestre</button>
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Energía</button>
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Ciber/Sat</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Map Surface Select -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">layers</span> Modo:
            </span>
<div class="flex bg-surface-container-highest rounded p-0.5">
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Satelital</button>
<button class="bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold uppercase">Vector Táctico</button>
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Comercial</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 2. ÁREA DE TRABAJO PRINCIPAL DUAL (Mapa Interactivo 60% + Panel de Lectura 40%) -->
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-md mb-space-xl">
<!-- Lado Izquierdo: Visor de Mapa Táctico Interactivo (7 cols ~ 58-60%) -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative">
<!-- Top HUD Header over Map -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-xs flex items-center justify-between z-20">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]">file_download_done</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">BAB EL-MANDEB CHOKEPOINT // SECTOR YEMEN-PERIM</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="text-primary animate-pulse">● RADAR ACTIVO</span>
<span class="text-outline">|</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">ESCALA: 1:75,000</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Canvas Area / Map Container -->
<div class="relative w-full h-[620px] bg-[#0b0e14] overflow-hidden select-none" id="tacticalMapContainer">
<!-- Cartographic Grid / Lat-Lon Lines SVG -->
<svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-40 z-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<defs>
<pattern height="80" id="grid" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="80">
<path d="M 80 0 L 0 0 0 80" fill="none" stroke="#1f2636" stroke-width="0.75"></path>
<circle cx="0" cy="0" fill="#3c4a42" r="1.5"></circle>
</pattern>
<!-- Radar sweep gradient -->
<radialgradient cx="50%" cy="50%" id="radarGlow" r="50%">
<stop offset="0%" stop-color="#10b981" stop-opacity="0.08"></stop>
<stop offset="70%" stop-color="#10b981" stop-opacity="0.02"></stop>
<stop offset="100%" stop-color="#10b981" stop-opacity="0"></stop>
</radialgradient>
</defs>
<rect fill="url(#grid)" height="100%" width="100%"></rect>
<!-- Crosshair coordinate lines -->
<line stroke="#1f2636" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-width="1" x1="50%" x2="50%" y1="0" y2="100%"></line>
<line stroke="#1f2636" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-width="1" x1="0" x2="100%" y1="50%" y2="50%"></line>
</svg>
<!-- Simulated Vector Landmasses & Bathymetry Silhouette -->
<svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 800 620">
<!-- Yemen Mainland (Top Right) -->
<path d="M 460,0 L 800,0 L 800,340 Q 680,310 610,340 T 510,400 Q 470,360 480,290 T 520,180 Q 480,100 460,0 Z" fill="#161b24" stroke="#2a3547" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
<text fill="#4d5c73" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="12" letter-spacing="3" x="660" y="140">COSTA DE YEMEN (HODEIDA/TAIZ)</text>
<!-- Djibouti / Eritrea African Horn (Bottom Left) -->
<path d="M 0,160 Q 90,190 140,260 T 190,380 Q 230,490 280,620 L 0,620 Z" fill="#161b24" stroke="#2a3547" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
<text fill="#4d5c73" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="12" letter-spacing="3" x="50" y="480">YIBUTI / ERITREA</text>
<text fill="#3c4a42" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" x="40" y="505">BASE MILITAR DORALEH (CHIN/FRA/USA)</text>
<!-- Perim Island (Center) -->
<path d="M 420,345 C 435,338 450,342 458,355 C 462,368 455,382 440,388 C 428,392 412,385 410,370 C 408,358 412,349 420,345 Z" fill="#263142" stroke="#4edea3" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
<text fill="#4edea3" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" x="400" y="330">ISLA DE PERIM (MAYUN)</text>
<line stroke="#4edea3" stroke-width="1" x1="435" x2="435" y1="335" y2="350"></line>
<!-- Airstrips Vector Graphic on Perim -->
<line stroke="#ffffff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2.5" x1="422" x2="450" y1="358" y2="378"></line>
<line stroke="#10b981" stroke-dasharray="2,2" stroke-width="1" x1="423" x2="449" y1="360" y2="376"></line>
<!-- Normal Commercial Route (Radar Green lines) -->
<g opacity="0.95">
<path d="M 120,0 Q 260,200 370,320 T 470,490 Q 530,570 580,620" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-dasharray="6,4" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
<!-- Motion indicator circles -->
<circle cx="280" cy="225" fill="#10b981" r="3"></circle>
<circle cx="370" cy="320" fill="#10b981" r="3"></circle>
<circle cx="510" cy="540" fill="#10b981" r="3"></circle>
<text fill="#10b981" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" transform="rotate(38 240,160)" x="240" y="160">RIMA COMERCIAL SUR-NORTE (AIS ACTIVE)</text>
</g>
<!-- Exclusion Zone / Drone Target Cone (Red Dotted Area) -->
<polygon fill="#93000a" fill-opacity="0.12" points="560,260 750,380 620,530 460,420" stroke="#ffb4ab" stroke-dasharray="4,3" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<text fill="#ffb4ab" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" x="560" y="410">ÁREA DE EXCLUSIÓN: AMENAZA USV / DRONES</text>
<!-- Missile Threat Radius (Amber concentric circles from Yemen coast) -->
<circle cx="590" cy="280" fill="none" opacity="0.75" r="140" stroke="#ffb95f" stroke-dasharray="8,4" stroke-width="1.2"></circle>
<circle cx="590" cy="280" fill="none" opacity="0.45" r="230" stroke="#ffb95f" stroke-dasharray="4,6" stroke-width="0.8"></circle>
<circle cx="590" cy="280" fill="#ffb95f" r="5"></circle>
<text fill="#ffb95f" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9" x="602" y="278">ALCANCE AShM (C-802 / AL-MANDOOB)</text>
<!-- Western Channel (Bab Iskander) & Eastern Channel -->
<path d="M 330,360 L 370,410" stroke="#adc6ff" stroke-dasharray="2,2" stroke-width="1"></path>
<text fill="#adc6ff" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" x="250" y="420">CANAL OCCIDENTAL (DIRECCIÓN CANAL DE SUEZ)</text>
</svg>
<!-- Interactive Pins overlay (HTML positioned elements for crisp tooltips) -->
<div class="absolute z-30" style="top: 54%; left: 53%;">
<div class="relative group cursor-pointer" onclick="focusPin('perim')">
<span class="flex h-5 w-5 relative">
<span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75"></span>
<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-5 w-5 bg-primary text-on-primary items-center justify-center font-bold text-[10px] shadow-lg">1</span>
</span>
<!-- Pin Card -->
<div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mb-2 w-52 p-2 bg-surface-container-high/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded shadow-xl pointer-events-none opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200">
<div class="text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">PISTA MILITAR ISLA DE PERIM</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm mt-0.5">3,000m pista de asfalto y puestos de escucha SIGINT.</div>
<div class="mt-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">ESTADO: OPERATIVO NO RECONOCIDO</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute z-30" style="top: 41%; left: 74%;">
<div class="relative group cursor-pointer" onclick="focusPin('radar')">
<span class="flex h-4 w-4 relative">
<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-4 w-4 bg-tertiary-container text-on-tertiary items-center justify-center font-bold text-[9px]">2</span>
</span>
<div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mb-2 w-48 p-2 bg-surface-container-high/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded shadow-xl pointer-events-none opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200">
<div class="text-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">PUESTO DE RADAR COSTERO</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm mt-0.5">Vigilancia de superficie OTH montada en acantilados.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute z-30" style="top: 66%; left: 39%;">
<div class="relative group cursor-pointer" onclick="focusPin('canal')">
<span class="flex h-4 w-4 relative">
<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-4 w-4 bg-secondary text-on-secondary items-center justify-center font-bold text-[9px]">3</span>
</span>
<div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mb-2 w-48 p-2 bg-surface-container-high/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded shadow-xl pointer-events-none opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200">
<div class="text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">BAB ISKANDER (CANAL)</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm mt-0.5">Cuello de botella de 26 km de navegación forzosa.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute z-30" style="top: 28%; left: 34%;">
<div class="relative group cursor-pointer" onclick="focusPin('tankers')">
<span class="flex h-4 w-4 relative">
<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-4 w-4 bg-primary-fixed-dim text-on-primary-fixed items-center justify-center font-bold text-[9px]">4</span>
</span>
<div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mb-2 w-52 p-2 bg-surface-container-high/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded shadow-xl pointer-events-none opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200">
<div class="text-primary-fixed-dim font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">FONDEADERO DE PETROLEROS VLCC</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm mt-0.5">Buques en espera de escolta de convoy multinacional.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Floating Tactical Layer Controller Widget -->
<div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-20 bg-surface-container-low/90 backdrop-blur-md p-space-sm rounded shadow-2xl w-60">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1 mb-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface uppercase font-bold">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary">tune</span> Capas Activas</span>
<span class="text-outline">3/3</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<label class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-0.5 px-1 hover:bg-surface-container rounded">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Fronteras Internacionales</span>
<input checked="" class="accent-primary rounded cursor-pointer" type="checkbox"/>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-0.5 px-1 hover:bg-surface-container rounded">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Tráfico Marítimo AIS Vivo</span>
<input checked="" class="accent-primary rounded cursor-pointer" type="checkbox"/>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-0.5 px-1 hover:bg-surface-container rounded">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Cables Submarinos SubTel</span>
<input checked="" class="accent-primary rounded cursor-pointer" type="checkbox"/>
</label>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Floating Dynamic Scale & Coordinates Indicator (Bottom Bar) -->
<div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 z-20 flex items-center justify-between bg-surface-container-low/85 backdrop-blur px-space-md py-1.5 rounded">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface">
<span class="text-outline">POSICIÓN RETÍCULA:</span>
<span class="text-primary font-mono font-bold" id="coordDisplay">12°38'42"N 43°25'08"E</span>
</div>
<div class="text-outline font-mono">ALTURA SAT: 480 KM</div>
</div>
<!-- Nautical Scale Widget -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">
<span>0</span>
<div class="w-16 h-1 bg-surface-bright flex">
<div class="w-1/2 h-full bg-primary"></div>
<div class="w-1/2 h-full bg-on-surface"></div>
</div>
<span>10 NM (18.5 KM)</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Map Footer Controls: Zoom, Reset, Satellite Layer Switcher -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-2 flex items-center justify-between z-20">
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary">warning</span>
<span>ZONA DE RIESGO DE GUERRA: CONDICIÓN JWC ALTA (LLOYD'S 2024)</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1">
<button class="bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface p-1 rounded transition" title="Acercar">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">add</span>
</button>
<button class="bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface p-1 rounded transition" title="Alejar">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">remove</span>
</button>
<button class="bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface p-1 rounded transition" title="Centrar">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">filter_center_focus</span>
</button>
<button class="bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-1 rounded font-bold uppercase ml-2 flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">download</span> Exportar GeoJSON
          </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Lado Derecho: Panel de Lectura Analítica (5 cols ~ 40-42%) -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md shadow-xl justify-between">
<!-- Intel Header / Classification Rail -->
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm pb-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="bg-error-container text-on-error-container font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 font-bold uppercase rounded">
              OSINT 1A CONFIRMADO
            </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">SEC: MAR-ROJO-SUR</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">timer</span> 6 MIN LECTURA
          </span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight mb-space-xs">
          Análisis Táctico: La militarización de Perim y la asfixia del tráfico marítimo global
        </h2>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md text-body-sm font-body-sm text-outline mb-space-md">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant font-medium">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">verified_user</span> Comando Editorial Geopolítica
          </span>
<span>•</span>
<span>Actualizado hace 2 horas</span>
</div>
<!-- Accordion / Strategic Points Breakdown -->
<div class="space-y-space-sm overflow-y-auto max-h-[400px] pr-1">
<!-- Punto 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-sm rounded transition hover:bg-surface-container-high" id="section-perim-geo">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold uppercase">1. Posición Geográfica Clave en Bab el-Mandeb</span>
<button class="text-outline hover:text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1" onclick="focusPin('perim')">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">my_location</span> Enfocar
              </button>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              Con apenas 13 km² de superficie volcánica, la isla de Mayun (Perim) divide el estrecho en dos canales navegables. Su control ofrece dominio visual y de tiro directo sobre el paso del 12% del comercio marítimo mundial y más de 4.8 millones de barriles diarios de crudo.
            </p>
</div>
<!-- Punto 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-sm rounded transition hover:bg-surface-container-high" id="section-perim-runway">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold uppercase">2. La nueva pista aérea y hangares fortificados</span>
<button class="text-outline hover:text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1" onclick="focusPin('perim')">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">my_location</span> Enfocar
              </button>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              Imágenes de satélite de apertura sintética (SAR) revelan una pista asfaltada de 1,850 metros completada recientemente. Diseñada para desplegar drones de ataque MALE (Wing Loong / Mohajer) y aviones de patrulla marítima para proyectar vector ofensivo permanente.
            </p>
</div>
<!-- Punto 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-sm rounded transition hover:bg-surface-container-high" id="section-perim-insurance">
